#HIIT Workout App
Overview
This HIIT (High-Intensity Interval Training) Workout App allows users to select and carry out customizable workout routines. With a user-friendly interface, it provides a seamless experience for users to engage in efficient and effective workouts.

Features
Workout Selection: Users can choose from a variety of pre-designed HIIT workout routines or create their own custom routines.

Install dependencies using npm:
Copy code
npm install
or
Run the app locally:
npm start